Used a Nokia CA-42 datacable to connect, but had to add a 1K resistor between RX and 3.3V.
Default speed 57600,8N1

===== Similar Devices =====
MiniEMBWiFi available at [[http://www.omnima.co.uk/store/catalog/MiniEMBWiFi-p-16180.html|Omnima]] is based on the same reference design. The differences are as follows:

  - MiniEMBWiFi board has the serial port taken to a 4 pin 2.54mm pitch pinheader as standard
  - USB to serial JP2 pinheader cable is provided as an optional accessory
  - There are two plastic cases available for MiniEMBWiFi: Baige color case - for those who like a reto-80s look and feel, and aWhite color case with rounded edges - an up to date modern design
  - [[http://www.omnima.co.uk/store/product.php?productid=16189|STM32 Expander]] daughter board is available as an add-on to MiniEMBWiFi to provide additional capabilities for interfacing with 1-wire, Z-Wave, LCDs, X10, 2.4GHz radio communication, etc

